{"course":"cs101","n":1,"title":"Introduction to Computers, Programming and Java","titleAr":"مقدمة في الحاسب والبرمجة ولغة جافا","intro":"Welcome! You do not need any programming experience. In this unit you will learn, step by step, what a computer is, what a program is, and how Java turns your instructions into something the computer can run. You will write and run your first programs, meet the three kinds of errors, try an editor called NetBeans, and learn to plan a solution with pseudocode and flowcharts before you write any code. Finally, you will see how computers store numbers and text with bits, learn to write clean code, read error messages calmly, and build a printing project: a receipt, an ID card and a timetable.","introAr":"أهلاً {{name}}! لا تحتاج{{g:|ين}} إلى أي خبرة سابقة. في هذه الوحدة نتعلم خطوة خطوة ما هو الحاسب وما هو البرنامج وكيف تحوّل جافا تعليماتك إلى شيء يفهمه الحاسب، ثم تكتب{{g:|ين}} أول برامجك وتتعرف{{g:|ين}} على الأخطاء وعلى NetBeans وعلى التخطيط بالخوارزميات والمخططات الانسيابية، ثم النظام الثنائي، وأسلوب البرمجة الجيد، وقراءة رسائل الأخطاء، ومشروع طباعة.","file":"content/cs101-u1.js","v":"90af5f5764","lessons":[{"title":"What is a computer? Hardware and software","titleAr":"ما هو الحاسب؟ المكونات المادية والبرمجيات","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Programs and programming languages","titleAr":"البرامج ولغات البرمجة","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"How Java runs: compiler, bytecode and the JVM","titleAr":"كيف تعمل جافا: المترجم وbytecode وآلة JVM","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Your first Java program, line by line","titleAr":"أول برنامج جافا سطراً سطراً","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Printing: print, println and escape sequences","titleAr":"الطباعة: print وprintln ورموز الهروب","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Text, calculations and comments","titleAr":"النص والحسابات والتعليقات","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"The three kinds of errors","titleAr":"أنواع الأخطاء الثلاثة","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Using the NetBeans IDE","titleAr":"استخدام بيئة NetBeans","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Problem solving: algorithms, pseudocode and flowcharts","titleAr":"حل المسائل: الخوارزميات والشيفرة الزائفة والمخططات الانسيابية","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Bits, bytes and number systems","titleAr":"البتات والبايتات وأنظمة العد","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"Good programming style","titleAr":"أسلوب البرمجة الجيد","minutes":25,"practice":8},{"title":"Reading and fixing error messages in NetBeans","titleAr":"قراءة رسائل الأخطاء وإصلاحها في NetBeans","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"Printing project: a receipt, an ID card and a timetable","titleAr":"مشروع طباعة: فاتورة وبطاقة طالب وجدول","minutes":30,"practice":8}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":2,"title":"Input, Variables and Data Types","titleAr":"الإدخال والمتغيرات وأنواع البيانات","intro":"Real programs work with data that changes: marks, prices, ages, balances. In this unit you learn, slowly and one idea at a time, how to store data in variables, choose the right data type, do arithmetic, read input from the keyboard with Scanner, and convert between whole numbers and decimals. Memory pictures show what happens inside the computer. At the end you join text and numbers, meet the limits of numbers, solve real problems with input → process → output, and practise the most common traps.","introAr":"البرامج الحقيقية تتعامل مع بيانات متغيرة مثل الدرجات والأسعار. في هذه الوحدة نتعلم خطوة خطوة كيف نخزن البيانات في متغيرات ونختار نوعها ونجري العمليات الحسابية ونقرأ المدخلات ونحوّل بين الأنواع، ثم نحل مسائل حقيقية ونتدرب على الأخطاء الشائعة.","file":"content/cs101-u2.js","v":"cf7a972f87","lessons":[{"title":"Variables: boxes that hold values","titleAr":"المتغيرات: صناديق تحمل القيم","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Assignment: changing the value in a variable","titleAr":"الإسناد: تغيير القيمة في المتغير","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Choosing names and using constants","titleAr":"اختيار الأسماء واستخدام الثوابت","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Data types: choosing the right box","titleAr":"أنواع البيانات: اختيار الصندوق المناسب","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Arithmetic: +, -, *, / and %","titleAr":"العمليات الحسابية","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Operator precedence: what is calculated first?","titleAr":"أولوية العمليات","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Reading input with Scanner","titleAr":"قراءة المدخلات باستخدام Scanner","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Reading text lines: next() and nextLine()","titleAr":"قراءة النصوص: next() وnextLine()","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"Shortcuts: ++, -- and +=","titleAr":"العمليات المختصرة","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Type conversion and casting","titleAr":"تحويل الأنواع","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Joining text and numbers","titleAr":"ربط النصوص بالأعداد","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Limits of numbers: overflow and decimals","titleAr":"حدود الأعداد: الفيضان والكسور العشرية","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Problem solving: input → process → output","titleAr":"حل المسائل: إدخال ثم معالجة ثم إخراج","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Common pitfalls: a review with drills","titleAr":"أخطاء شائعة: مراجعة وتدريب","minutes":30,"practice":10}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":3,"title":"Selection Statements","titleAr":"جمل الاختيار","intro":"Until now your programs ran every line, one after the other. Real programs must decide: pass or fail, enough money or not, which day of the week. In this unit you will learn true/false values, how to compare numbers, how to combine questions, and every way Java chooses what to do: if, if-else, chains of choices, switch, and the short ?: choice. Then you will store decisions in boolean flags, compare text and decimals safely, test every path of a program, and build a small delivery fee project. We go slowly, one small idea at a time.","introAr":"حتى الآن كانت برامجك تنفذ كل سطر بالترتيب. البرامج الحقيقية تحتاج إلى اتخاذ قرارات: نجاح أو رسوب، رصيد كافٍ أو لا. في هذه الوحدة ستتعلم قيم صح/خطأ، ومقارنة الأعداد، ودمج الأسئلة، وجمل if و if-else و switch والعامل ?:، ثم المتغيرات المنطقية، ومقارنة النصوص والأعداد العشرية، واختبار كل المسارات، ومشروعاً صغيراً، خطوة بخطوة.","file":"content/cs101-u3.js","v":"089962c6a2","lessons":[{"title":"True or false: boolean values","titleAr":"صح أو خطأ: القيم المنطقية","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Combining questions: and, or, not","titleAr":"دمج الأسئلة: and و or و not","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Ranges, precedence and short-circuit","titleAr":"المدى والأولوية والتقييم المختصر","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"The if statement","titleAr":"جملة if","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"The if-else statement","titleAr":"جملة if-else","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"Nested if: a decision inside a decision","titleAr":"if متداخلة: قرار داخل قرار","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Many choices: the else-if chain","titleAr":"خيارات متعددة: سلسلة else if","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"The switch statement","titleAr":"جملة switch","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"switch: fall-through and grouped cases","titleAr":"switch: الانسياب وتجميع الحالات","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"The conditional operator ?:","titleAr":"العامل الشرطي ?:","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"Boolean variables and flags","titleAr":"المتغيرات المنطقية والأعلام","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Comparing text and decimal numbers","titleAr":"مقارنة النصوص والأعداد العشرية","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Testing every path","titleAr":"اختبار كل المسارات","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Project: a delivery fee calculator","titleAr":"مشروع: حاسبة رسوم التوصيل","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":4,"title":"Math Library, Characters and Strings","titleAr":"مكتبة الرياضيات والحروف والنصوص","intro":"Real programs compute square roots, round prices, look at single letters, and work with names and messages. In this unit you will use the ready-made Math tools of Java, learn how letters are stored as numbers, print neat tables with printf, and use the String type to work with words: cut, search, clean, compare, and convert text to numbers. At the end you will build a receipt formatter. We go one small idea at a time.","introAr":"تحتاج البرامج الحقيقية إلى حساب الجذور وتقريب الأسعار وفحص الحروف ومعالجة الأسماء. في هذه الوحدة ستستخدم أدوات Math الجاهزة، وتتعرف على تخزين الحروف كأرقام، وتطبع جداول منسقة بـ printf، وتتعامل مع النصوص String: قصاً وبحثاً وتنظيفاً ومقارنة وتحويلاً إلى أرقام، ثم تبني مشروع إيصال منسق.","file":"content/cs101-u4.js","v":"3c64bbbb44","lessons":[{"title":"The Math class: pow, sqrt, abs, max, min","titleAr":"الصنف Math: الدوال الأساسية","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Rounding numbers: round, ceil and floor","titleAr":"تقريب الأعداد: round و ceil و floor","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Random numbers","titleAr":"الأعداد العشوائية","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Neat output with printf","titleAr":"مخرجات منسقة باستخدام printf","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"printf: width, alignment and String.format","titleAr":"printf: العرض والمحاذاة و String.format","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"The char type and Unicode codes","titleAr":"النوع char وأرقام يونيكود","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Character arithmetic and the Character class","titleAr":"العمليات على الحروف والصنف Character","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Escape sequences","titleAr":"تسلسلات الهروب","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Strings: your first text","titleAr":"النصوص String: البداية","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Cutting and searching: substring, indexOf, case","titleAr":"القص والبحث: substring و indexOf وحالة الأحرف","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Comparing strings: equals and compareTo","titleAr":"مقارنة النصوص: equals و compareTo","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Reading strings: next and nextLine","titleAr":"قراءة النصوص: next و nextLine","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"More String tools: trim, replace, contains, startsWith","titleAr":"أدوات نصية أخرى: trim و replace و contains و startsWith","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Strings are immutable: new objects, not changes","titleAr":"النصوص غير قابلة للتغيير: كائنات جديدة لا تعديلات","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Text and numbers: parseInt, parseDouble, valueOf","titleAr":"التحويل بين النص والأرقام","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Project: a receipt and ID card formatter","titleAr":"مشروع: منسّق الإيصال وبطاقة الهوية","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":5,"title":"Loops","titleAr":"الحلقات التكرارية","intro":"Loops let a program repeat work: read 40 grades, add up a bill, keep asking until the input is valid, or draw a table. In this unit you will master the while, do-while and for loops, counter- and sentinel-controlled repetition, accumulators, nested loops, break and continue, and learn how to avoid the classic off-by-one mistakes. Then you will use loops on text and on the digits of numbers, solve classic problems (primes, GCD, Fibonacci), build small simulations and games, and learn to plan any loop with four questions.","introAr":"الحلقات تجعل البرنامج يكرر العمل: قراءة الدرجات، جمع الفواتير، التحقق من المدخلات، ورسم الجداول. ستتعلم حلقات while و do-while و for، والتكرار بعداد أو بقيمة حارسة، والمجمّعات، والحلقات المتداخلة، و break و continue، وتجنب أخطاء الفرق بواحد. ثم تستخدم الحلقات على النصوص وأرقام الأعداد، وتحل مسائل مشهورة، وتبني ألعاباً بسيطة، وتخطط لأي حلقة بأربعة أسئلة.","file":"content/cs101-u5.js","v":"08262f08cd","lessons":[{"title":"Your first while loop","titleAr":"أول حلقة while","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Tracing while loops by hand","titleAr":"تتبع حلقة while بخطوات يدوية","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Sentinel loops: stop when the user says stop","titleAr":"القيمة الحارسة: التوقف عند إشارة المستخدم","minutes":40,"practice":10},{"title":"do-while and input validation","titleAr":"حلقة do-while والتحقق من المدخلات","minutes":40,"practice":10},{"title":"The for loop","titleAr":"حلقة for","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Accumulators: sum, average, maximum and minimum","titleAr":"المجمّعات: المجموع والمتوسط والأكبر والأصغر","minutes":40,"practice":12},{"title":"Nested loops: patterns and tables","titleAr":"الحلقات المتداخلة: الأشكال والجداول","minutes":40,"practice":12},{"title":"break and continue","titleAr":"break و continue","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Choosing the right loop and off-by-one errors","titleAr":"اختيار الحلقة المناسبة وخطأ الفرق بواحد","minutes":40,"practice":10},{"title":"Loops over text: counting, reversing, palindromes","titleAr":"الحلقات على النصوص: العدّ والعكس والكلمات المتناظرة","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Loops over the digits of a number","titleAr":"الحلقات على أرقام العدد","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Classic number loops: primes, GCD, tables, Fibonacci","titleAr":"حلقات الأعداد المشهورة: الأولية والقاسم المشترك والجداول وفيبوناتشي","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Simulations and games","titleAr":"المحاكاة والألعاب","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Planning a loop: the four questions","titleAr":"تخطيط الحلقة: الأسئلة الأربعة","minutes":30,"practice":7}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":6,"title":"Methods","titleAr":"الدوال (الطرق)","intro":"Until now, all your code lived in main. When a program grows, main becomes long and you copy and paste the same lines again and again. A method is a small named piece of code that does one job. You write it once and use it as often as you like. In this unit you will write and call methods step by step, give them inputs (parameters), get answers back (return values), and learn how to plan a bigger program in small pieces. Then you will build your own text and number tools, test them with PASS/FAIL checks, document them, and finish with a menu-driven converter.","introAr":"حتى الآن كان كل الكود داخل main. عندما يكبر البرنامج نكرر الأسطر نفسها كثيراً. الدالة قطعة صغيرة لها اسم تؤدي عملاً واحداً، نكتبها مرة واحدة ونستخدمها متى شئنا. ستتعلم كتابة الدوال واستدعاءها، وإعطاءها مدخلات (معاملات)، واسترجاع نتيجة منها، وتقسيم البرنامج الكبير إلى أجزاء صغيرة. ثم تبني أدوات للنصوص والأعداد، وتختبرها، وتوثقها، وتنهي الوحدة بمشروع محوّل وحدات بقائمة.","file":"content/cs101-u6.js","v":"9f2daa5b81","lessons":[{"title":"What is a method? Writing and calling your first one","titleAr":"ما هي الدالة؟ كتابتها واستدعاؤها","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"Methods that call methods: the call stack","titleAr":"دوال تستدعي دوال: مكدس الاستدعاءات","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Parameters and arguments: giving a method its input","titleAr":"المعاملات والوسائط: إعطاء الدالة مدخلات","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Pass-by-value: methods work on copies","titleAr":"التمرير بالقيمة: الدوال تعمل على نسخ","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Return values: methods that give an answer back","titleAr":"القيم المرجعة: دوال تعطي جواباً","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Boolean methods and \"missing return\"","titleAr":"الدوال المنطقية وخطأ missing return","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Method overloading: one name, several versions","titleAr":"التحميل الزائد: اسم واحد وعدة نسخ","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Variable scope: where a variable lives","titleAr":"نطاق المتغيرات: أين يعيش المتغير؟","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Designing with small methods (stepwise refinement)","titleAr":"التصميم بدوال صغيرة (التحسين التدريجي)","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Methods that work on text","titleAr":"دوال تعمل على النصوص","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"A toolbox of number methods","titleAr":"صندوق أدوات من دوال الأعداد","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Testing a method: PASS or FAIL","titleAr":"اختبار الدالة: نجاح أو فشل","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Documenting methods: names, comments and headers","titleAr":"توثيق الدوال: الأسماء والتعليقات ورأس الدالة","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Project: a menu-driven unit converter","titleAr":"مشروع: محوّل وحدات بقائمة اختيارات","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":7,"title":"Arrays","titleAr":"المصفوفات","intro":"Until now, one variable held one value. But a class has 30 marks, and a shop has 100 prices. An array lets you keep many values of the same type under one name, and a loop can then handle all of them. In small, slow steps you will learn to create arrays, use indexes, loop over arrays, copy them, pass them to methods, search them and sort them. Then you will use arrays of names and letters, parallel arrays, counting arrays, change arrays in place, and finish with a class marks analyser.","introAr":"المصفوفة تخزّن قيمًا كثيرة من النوع نفسه تحت اسم واحد، فنعالج 30 درجة أو 100 سعر بحلقة واحدة. ستتعلم بخطوات صغيرة إنشاء المصفوفات والفهارس والحلقات والنسخ والدوال والبحث والترتيب، ثم مصفوفات النصوص والمصفوفات المتوازية والعدّ والتعديل، وتختم بمشروع لتحليل درجات الشعبة.","file":"content/cs101-u7.js","v":"68f7cc803c","lessons":[{"title":"Your first array","titleAr":"مصفوفتك الأولى","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"Filling arrays with values you know","titleAr":"تعبئة المصفوفة بقيم معروفة","minutes":25,"practice":12},{"title":"Visiting every box with a loop","titleAr":"المرور على كل الصناديق بحلقة","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"Sum, average, largest and smallest","titleAr":"المجموع والمتوسط وأكبر وأصغر قيمة","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Reading input into an array; copying arrays","titleAr":"قراءة المدخلات في مصفوفة ونسخ المصفوفات","minutes":30,"practice":12},{"title":"Arrays and methods","titleAr":"المصفوفات والدوال","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"The Arrays helper class","titleAr":"الصنف Arrays المساعد","minutes":25,"practice":12},{"title":"Linear search","titleAr":"البحث الخطي","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"Binary search","titleAr":"البحث الثنائي","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Selection sort","titleAr":"الترتيب بالاختيار","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Insertion sort","titleAr":"الترتيب بالإدراج","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Arrays of Strings and chars","titleAr":"مصفوفات النصوص والحروف","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Parallel arrays","titleAr":"المصفوفات المتوازية","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Counting with an array","titleAr":"العدّ باستخدام مصفوفة","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Changing an array: reverse, rotate, insert and remove","titleAr":"تعديل المصفوفة: العكس والتدوير والإدراج والحذف","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Project: a class marks analyser","titleAr":"مشروع: محلل درجات الشعبة","minutes":30,"practice":8}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs101","n":8,"title":"Text Files Input/Output","titleAr":"إدخال وإخراج الملفات النصية","intro":"When a program ends, everything in its variables is lost. A text file keeps your data on the disk, so you can use it again tomorrow. In this unit you will save text into a file, read it back, and process the data (totals, averages, the best value). You will also learn what to do when a file is missing, how to add to a file without erasing it, how to read comma-separated records, how to search a file, and how to write a neat report. The unit ends with a small project. In every program, we first write the file and then read it back, so you can see the whole story in one run.","introAr":"عند انتهاء البرنامج تضيع كل البيانات في المتغيرات. الملف النصي يحفظ بياناتك على القرص لتستخدمها لاحقاً. ستتعلم حفظ النص في ملف وقراءته ومعالجة البيانات (مجاميع ومتوسطات)، وماذا تفعل عندما يكون الملف مفقوداً، والإضافة إلى ملف، وقراءة ملفات CSV، والبحث، وكتابة تقرير مرتب، ثم مشروعاً صغيراً. في كل برنامج نكتب الملف أولاً ثم نقرؤه.","file":"content/cs101-u8.js","v":"639cf2fb7e","lessons":[{"title":"Saving text in a file with PrintWriter","titleAr":"حفظ النص في ملف باستخدام PrintWriter","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"The File class and why main says \"throws Exception\"","titleAr":"الصنف File ولماذا نكتب throws Exception","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"Reading a file line by line with Scanner","titleAr":"قراءة الملف سطراً سطراً باستخدام Scanner","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"Reading numbers and records from a file","titleAr":"قراءة الأعداد والسجلات من ملف","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"When the file is missing: try-catch","titleAr":"عندما يكون الملف مفقوداً: try-catch","minutes":25,"practice":11},{"title":"try-with-resources and processing one file into another","titleAr":"try مع الموارد ومعالجة ملف إلى ملف آخر","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Adding to a file without erasing it","titleAr":"الإضافة إلى ملف دون مسحه","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Records separated by commas: split and parse","titleAr":"سجلات تفصلها فواصل: split والتحويل إلى أعداد","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Counting and searching in a file","titleAr":"العدّ والبحث في ملف","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Writing a neat report file with printf","titleAr":"كتابة ملف تقرير مرتب باستخدام printf","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Project: a class results report","titleAr":"مشروع: تقرير نتائج الصف","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs102","n":1,"title":"Two-Dimensional Arrays","titleAr":"المصفوفات ثنائية الأبعاد","intro":"Many things come as tables: the marks of students in several quizzes, the sales of branches in each quarter, the seats of a cinema, or a timetable. A two-dimensional array keeps such a table in rows and columns. You already know one-dimensional arrays (one row of boxes). In small steps you will learn to create a table, visit every cell with nested loops, add up rows and columns, use rows of different lengths, pass tables to methods, and do matrix addition, transpose and multiplication. Then you will store names and letters in tables, search a table, walk through it in different orders, build a tic-tac-toe referee, and learn the difference between a shallow and a deep copy.","introAr":"كثير من البيانات تأتي على شكل جداول. المصفوفة ثنائية الأبعاد تخزّن الجدول في صفوف وأعمدة. ستتعلم بخطوات صغيرة إنشاءها ومعالجتها بالحلقات المتداخلة، والمصفوفات غير المنتظمة، وتمريرها للدوال، وعمليات المصفوفات الرياضية، ثم جداول الأسماء والحروف، والبحث في الجدول، ولعبة XO، والنسخ السطحي والعميق.","file":"content/cs102-u1.js","v":"0ef2c6cb16","lessons":[{"title":"A table of boxes: rows and columns","titleAr":"جدول من الصناديق: صفوف وأعمدة","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Filling and printing a table with nested loops","titleAr":"تعبئة الجدول وطباعته بحلقات متداخلة","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Reading a table and adding up rows","titleAr":"قراءة جدول وجمع الصفوف","minutes":40,"practice":10},{"title":"Columns, the largest value and the diagonal","titleAr":"الأعمدة وأكبر قيمة والقطر","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Ragged arrays: rows of different lengths","titleAr":"المصفوفات غير المنتظمة","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Passing and returning tables","titleAr":"تمرير الجداول وإرجاعها من الدوال","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Matrices: addition and transpose","titleAr":"المصفوفات الرياضية: الجمع والمنقول","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Matrix multiplication and a table application","titleAr":"ضرب المصفوفات وتطبيق على الجداول","minutes":45,"practice":11},{"title":"Tables of words and letters: String and char","titleAr":"جداول الكلمات والحروف: String وchar","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Searching a table","titleAr":"البحث في جدول","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Traversal patterns and quick printing","titleAr":"طرق المرور على الجدول والطباعة السريعة","minutes":25,"practice":8},{"title":"Project: who won the tic-tac-toe game?","titleAr":"مشروع: من فاز في لعبة XO؟","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Copying tables: shallow and deep copies","titleAr":"نسخ الجداول: النسخ السطحي والنسخ العميق","minutes":30,"practice":8}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs102","n":2,"title":"Class Design","titleAr":"تصميم الأصناف","intro":"In CS101 you wrote everything inside main. Now you will design your own types. A class is a blueprint, and an object is a thing built from it. Step by step you will learn fields, methods, constructors, this, getters and setters, toString and equals, static members, abstract classes and UML drawings. Then you will see how objects travel to and from methods, how to use null safely, how to design a class from a short story, and why immutable objects are safe to share. Memory pictures show what every line does to the variables and the objects. Go slowly: every lesson has worked examples and small exercises.","introAr":"في CS101 كتبت كل شيء داخل main. هنا ستصمم أنواعك الخاصة: الصنف مخطط والكائن شيء مبني منه. سنتعلم الحقول والدوال والمُنشئات و this والتغليف و toString و equals والأعضاء الساكنة والأصناف المجردة ومخططات UML، ثم تمرير الكائنات إلى الدوال، والتعامل الآمن مع null، وتصميم صنف من قصة، والكائنات غير القابلة للتغيير. صور الذاكرة توضح أثر كل سطر.","file":"content/cs102-u2.js","v":"e3733bf0b1","lessons":[{"title":"Why classes? Blueprints and objects","titleAr":"لماذا الأصناف؟ المخطط والكائنات","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Methods in a class and references","titleAr":"الدوال داخل الصنف والمراجع","minutes":40,"practice":10},{"title":"Constructors","titleAr":"المُنشئات","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"this, copy constructors and chaining","titleAr":"this ومُنشئ النسخ وربط المُنشئات","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Encapsulation: private fields, getters and setters","titleAr":"التغليف: الحقول الخاصة ودوال الجلب والتعيين","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"toString and equals","titleAr":"toString و equals","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Static members: things shared by the whole class","titleAr":"الأعضاء الساكنة: ما يشترك فيه الصنف كله","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Abstract classes and UML diagrams","titleAr":"الأصناف المجردة ومخططات UML","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Passing objects to methods and returning objects","titleAr":"تمرير الكائنات إلى الدوال وإرجاعها","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"null and NullPointerException","titleAr":"القيمة null والخطأ NullPointerException","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Designing a class from a problem description","titleAr":"تصميم صنف من وصف المسألة","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Immutable objects","titleAr":"الكائنات غير القابلة للتغيير","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""}},
{"course":"cs102","n":4,"title":"Inheritance","titleAr":"الوراثة","intro":"Inheritance lets you build a new class on top of an existing one. A Manager is an Employee, a Car is a Vehicle: the new class reuses what the old class already has and adds only what is special. In this unit you go slowly, step by step: the is-a idea, extends, the Object class, super, constructor order, overriding, protected, superclass references, instanceof and getClass(). Then you design hierarchies from a story, write toString and equals for a family of classes, use final and the four access levels, choose between is-a and has-a, and build a complete university people system.","introAr":"الوراثة تسمح ببناء صنف جديد فوق صنف موجود: المدير موظف، والسيارة مركبة. الصنف الفرعي يعيد استخدام ما في الصنف الأب ويضيف ما يميزه. سنتقدم ببطء وخطوة خطوة، ثم نصمم هرميات كاملة ونختار بين الوراثة والتركيب، وننهي بدراسة حالة لنظام أفراد الجامعة.","file":"content/cs102-u3.js","v":"cd30f13b27","lessons":[{"title":"The is-a idea and extends","titleAr":"فكرة \"هو\" و extends","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"The Object class and single inheritance","titleAr":"الصنف Object والوراثة الأحادية","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"super and the order of constructors","titleAr":"super وترتيب المُنشئات","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Overriding: changing inherited behaviour","titleAr":"التجاوز: تغيير السلوك الموروث","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Overloading vs overriding, and protected","titleAr":"التحميل الزائد مقابل التجاوز و protected","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Superclass references and class hierarchies","titleAr":"مراجع الصنف الأب وهرميات الأصناف","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"instanceof, casting and getClass()","titleAr":"instanceof والتحويل و getClass()","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Designing a hierarchy from a story","titleAr":"تصميم هرمية من وصف مكتوب","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"toString and equals in a hierarchy","titleAr":"toString و equals في الهرمية","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"final classes and methods, and the four access levels","titleAr":"الأصناف والدوال final ومستويات الوصول الأربعة","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"is-a or has-a? Inheritance or composition","titleAr":"\"هو\" أم \"يملك\"؟ الوراثة أم التركيب","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Case study: a university people system","titleAr":"دراسة حالة: نظام لأفراد الجامعة","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":3},
{"course":"cs102","n":5,"title":"Polymorphism and Interfaces","titleAr":"تعدد الأشكال والواجهات","intro":"Polymorphism means one piece of code working with many types of objects. A Shape variable can hold a Circle or a Rectangle, and calling area() runs the right version automatically. Step by step you will learn dynamic binding, upcasting and downcasting, abstract classes, interfaces and multiple inheritance through interfaces, sorting with Comparable and Comparator, and a first taste of lambda expressions. The last lessons put it all together: tracing which method runs, a payroll with one loop, default and static interface methods, and the design of a small delivery app with a UML diagram.","introAr":"تعدد الأشكال يعني أن كودًا واحدًا يعمل مع أنواع كثيرة من الكائنات. سنتعلم خطوة بخطوة: الربط الديناميكي، والتحويل بين الأنواع، والأصناف المجردة، والواجهات والوراثة المتعددة عبرها، والترتيب بـ Comparable و Comparator، وتعبيرات لامدا، ثم نجمع كل ذلك في تصميم تطبيق توصيل صغير.","file":"content/cs102-u4.js","v":"a3e7feb77f","lessons":[{"title":"One reference, many forms","titleAr":"مرجع واحد وأشكال كثيرة","minutes":40,"practice":12},{"title":"Upcasting, downcasting and instanceof","titleAr":"التحويل بين الأنواع و instanceof","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Abstract classes and abstract methods","titleAr":"الأصناف والدوال المجردة","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Interfaces","titleAr":"الواجهات","minutes":40,"practice":12},{"title":"Comparable: sorting your own objects","titleAr":"الواجهة Comparable: ترتيب كائناتك","minutes":40,"practice":11},{"title":"Functional interfaces and lambdas","titleAr":"الواجهات الوظيفية وتعبيرات لامدا","minutes":35,"practice":11},{"title":"Dynamic binding step by step","titleAr":"الربط الديناميكي خطوة بخطوة","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Polymorphic arrays in practice: a payroll","titleAr":"المصفوفات متعددة الأشكال عمليًا: كشف الرواتب","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Interfaces in more depth: default, static and extends","titleAr":"الواجهات بعمق: default و static و extends","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Comparator vs Comparable: sorting by different keys","titleAr":"Comparator مقابل Comparable: الترتيب بمفاتيح مختلفة","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Designing with abstract classes and interfaces together","titleAr":"التصميم بالأصناف المجردة والواجهات معًا","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":4},
{"course":"cs102","n":7,"title":"Java Collections Framework","titleAr":"إطار المجموعات في جافا","intro":"An array has a fixed size, but real programs need lists that grow and shrink, sets without repeats, and maps that find a value from a key. Java gives you ready-made tools for this: ArrayList, LinkedList, HashSet, TreeSet, HashMap, TreeMap, PriorityQueue and ArrayDeque (for stacks and queues). In this unit you meet them one small step at a time, learn to choose the right one, and finish by rebuilding a course registration system with them.","introAr":"المصفوفة ثابتة الحجم، لكن البرامج الحقيقية تحتاج قوائم تكبر وتصغر، ومجموعات بلا تكرار، وخرائط تجد القيمة من المفتاح، وطوابير ومكدسات. في هذه الوحدة نتعرف على هذه الأدوات خطوة صغيرة بعد خطوة، ونتعلم اختيار المناسب منها، ثم نبني بها نظام تسجيل مقررات.","file":"content/cs102-u5.js","v":"f4dce5f9e4","lessons":[{"title":"Arrays review and the Arrays class","titleAr":"مراجعة المصفوفات والصنف Arrays","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Arrays.binarySearch and Arrays.asList","titleAr":"البحث الثنائي و Arrays.asList","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"ArrayList: your first growable list","titleAr":"ArrayList: أول قائمة قابلة للنمو","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"ArrayList of numbers: Integer, remove and loops","titleAr":"ArrayList للأعداد: Integer والحذف والحلقات","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"LinkedList: a chain of nodes","titleAr":"LinkedList: سلسلة من العُقَد","minutes":25,"practice":9},{"title":"Iterator and ListIterator","titleAr":"المُكرِّر Iterator و ListIterator","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"HashSet: a collection with no repeats","titleAr":"HashSet: مجموعة بلا تكرار","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"HashMap: finding a value from a key","titleAr":"HashMap: إيجاد القيمة من المفتاح","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"Looping over a map and counting words","titleAr":"المرور على الخريطة وعدّ الكلمات","minutes":30,"practice":11},{"title":"PriorityQueue: the most urgent first","titleAr":"PriorityQueue: الأهم أولاً","minutes":25,"practice":10},{"title":"The Collections helper class","titleAr":"الصنف المساعد Collections","minutes":25,"practice":9},{"title":"A list of your own objects","titleAr":"قائمة من كائناتك الخاصة","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"TreeSet and TreeMap: always in order","titleAr":"TreeSet و TreeMap: مرتبة دائماً","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Stacks and queues with ArrayDeque","titleAr":"المكدس والطابور باستخدام ArrayDeque","minutes":30,"practice":6},{"title":"Choosing the right collection","titleAr":"اختيار المجموعة المناسبة","minutes":25,"practice":6},{"title":"Mini project: a course registration manager","titleAr":"مشروع مصغّر: نظام تسجيل المقررات","minutes":30,"practice":6}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":5},
{"course":"cs102","n":8,"title":"Generics","titleAr":"الأنواع العامة (Generics)","intro":"Generics let you write a class, interface or method once and use it safely with many types: an ArrayList of String, a Box of Integer, a Pair of String and Double. The compiler checks the types for you, so mistakes are caught before the program runs and you no longer need casts. Step by step you will use generic types, write your own generic methods and classes, restrict them with bounds, and implement generic interfaces such as Comparable. Then you will build generic containers and a toolbox of array methods, master the wildcards ?, ? extends and ? super, see what the compiler does behind the scenes (type erasure), and finish with a mini project that reuses the same generic code in a grade book and a shop.","introAr":"تسمح الأنواع العامة بكتابة صنف أو دالة مرة واحدة واستخدامها بأمان مع أنواع مختلفة؛ يكتشف المترجم الأخطاء مبكراً ولا نحتاج إلى التحويل (cast). سنبني حاويات عامة، ونتقن أحرف البدل، ونفهم محو الأنواع، ونختم بمشروع مصغر.","file":"content/cs102-u6.js","v":"28f9232340","lessons":[{"title":"Why generics?","titleAr":"لماذا الأنواع العامة؟","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Generic methods","titleAr":"الدوال العامة","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Writing a generic class","titleAr":"كتابة صنف عام","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Two type parameters and a generic stack","titleAr":"معاملا نوع ومكدس عام","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Bounded types and Comparable","titleAr":"الأنواع المقيَّدة و Comparable","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"Generic interfaces and wildcards","titleAr":"الواجهات العامة وأحرف البدل","minutes":35,"practice":12},{"title":"A generic container class with a list inside","titleAr":"صنف حاوية عام بداخله قائمة","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"A toolbox of generic methods for arrays","titleAr":"صندوق أدوات من الدوال العامة للمصفوفات","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Wildcards in depth","titleAr":"أحرف البدل بالتفصيل","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"What the compiler does with generics","titleAr":"ماذا يفعل المترجم بالأنواع العامة؟","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Mini project: Pair and Result in a grade book and a shop","titleAr":"مشروع مصغر: Pair و Result في دفتر درجات ومتجر","minutes":30,"practice":7}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":6},
{"course":"cs102","n":9,"title":"Recursion","titleAr":"الاستدعاء الذاتي (التكرار العودي)","intro":"A recursive method solves a problem by calling itself on a smaller copy of the same problem, until the problem is so small that the answer is obvious. In this unit you learn the two parts of every recursive method, how to follow the call stack step by step with memory pictures, and how to use recursion for factorials, digits, Fibonacci numbers, strings, arrays, binary search, printing patterns, the GCD, binary numbers, the Tower of Hanoi and permutations.","introAr":"الدالة العودية تحل المسألة باستدعاء نفسها على نسخة أصغر منها حتى تصبح الإجابة واضحة. ستتعلم جزأي الدالة العودية، وكيف تتتبع مكدس الاستدعاءات خطوة بخطوة بصور الذاكرة، ثم تطبقها على مسائل كلاسيكية مثل المصفوفات والأنماط وبرج هانوي والتباديل.","file":"content/cs102-u7.js","v":"4498a617b4","lessons":[{"title":"What is recursion? Base case and recursive case","titleAr":"ما هو الاستدعاء الذاتي؟ الحالة الأساسية والحالة العودية","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"The call stack: what happens on the way down and up","titleAr":"مكدس الاستدعاءات: ماذا يحدث عند النزول والصعود","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"Methods that return a value: factorial","titleAr":"دوال عودية تُرجع قيمة: المضروب","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"When recursion never stops: StackOverflowError","titleAr":"عندما لا تتوقف العودية: StackOverflowError","minutes":30,"practice":10},{"title":"Digits and powers","titleAr":"أرقام العدد والقوى","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Fibonacci numbers: two calls at once","titleAr":"أعداد فيبوناتشي: استدعاءان معاً","minutes":35,"practice":10},{"title":"Recursion on text: reverse and palindrome","titleAr":"العودية على النصوص: العكس والتناظر","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"Helper methods: carrying extra information","titleAr":"الدوال المساعدة: حمل معلومات إضافية","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"Recursive binary search","titleAr":"البحث الثنائي العودي","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"Recursion or loops?","titleAr":"العودية أم الحلقات؟","minutes":35,"practice":9},{"title":"Recursion on arrays: sum, maximum, count and search","titleAr":"العودية على المصفوفات: المجموع والأكبر والعدّ والبحث","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Printing patterns: count down, count up and triangles","titleAr":"أنماط الطباعة: العد التنازلي والتصاعدي والمثلثات","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"Classic problems: GCD, binary numbers and digit sums","titleAr":"مسائل كلاسيكية: القاسم المشترك الأكبر والنظام الثنائي ومجموع الأرقام","minutes":30,"practice":7},{"title":"The Tower of Hanoi","titleAr":"برج هانوي","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Strings and lists: counting, cleaning and permutations","titleAr":"النصوص والقوائم: العدّ والتنظيف والتباديل","minutes":30,"practice":7}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":7},
{"course":"cs102","n":3,"title":"Building Systems from Several Classes","titleAr":"بناء أنظمة من عدة أصناف","intro":"In Unit 2 you built one class at a time. Real programs, such as a clinic system, a library or a course registration system, are made of several classes that work together. In this unit you will put objects inside objects, decide when a part is owned or shared, keep many objects in an array, let objects call each other, turn a story into a UML design, and finally build and test a small registration system step by step.","introAr":"في الوحدة الثانية بنيت صنفًا واحدًا في كل مرة. البرامج الحقيقية مكوّنة من عدة أصناف تتعاون معًا. سنضع كائنات داخل كائنات، ونحفظ كائنات كثيرة في مصفوفة، ونجعل الكائنات تتواصل، ونحوّل القصة إلى تصميم، ثم نبني نظام تسجيل ونختبره.","file":"content/cs102-u8.js","v":"67a07e3503","lessons":[{"title":"Has-a: an object inside an object","titleAr":"علاقة «يملك»: كائن داخل كائن","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Building and using the parts","titleAr":"بناء الأجزاء واستخدامها","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Owned or shared parts","titleAr":"أجزاء مملوكة أو مشتركة","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Arrays of objects","titleAr":"مصفوفات الكائنات","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"A class that manages many objects","titleAr":"صنف يدير كائنات كثيرة","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Objects that talk to each other","titleAr":"كائنات تتواصل فيما بينها","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"From a story to a design","titleAr":"من القصة إلى التصميم","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Case study 1: designing and building a registration system","titleAr":"دراسة حالة ١: تصميم نظام تسجيل وبناؤه","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Case study 2: testing the system","titleAr":"دراسة حالة ٢: اختبار النظام","minutes":30,"practice":8}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"","titleAr":""},"key":8},
{"course":"cs102","n":6,"title":"Exceptions and Testing","titleAr":"الاستثناءات واختبار البرامج","intro":"A program can compile with no errors and still stop suddenly while it runs: a division by zero, an index that does not exist, a user who types letters instead of a number. In this unit you learn to read crash messages, catch exceptions with try and catch, clean up with finally, make keyboard input safe, protect your objects by throwing exceptions, write your own exception classes, and test your code with normal, boundary and invalid cases. At the end, your programs stay calm when something goes wrong, and you can prove that they work.","introAr":"قد يُترجَم البرنامج بلا أخطاء ثم يتوقف فجأة أثناء التشغيل. في هذه الوحدة تتعلم{{g:|ين}} قراءة رسائل الأخطاء، والتقاط الاستثناءات، ورميها لحماية الكائنات، وكتابة استثناءاتك الخاصة، واختبار برامجك لتتأكد{{g:|ي}} أنها تعمل.","file":"content/cs102-u9.js","v":"5a8caf5982","lessons":[{"title":"When programs crash","titleAr":"عندما يتوقف البرنامج فجأة","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"try and catch","titleAr":"التقاط الاستثناء: try و catch","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"Several catch blocks and the exception family","titleAr":"عدة كتل catch وشجرة عائلة الاستثناءات","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"finally and try-with-resources","titleAr":"الكتلة finally و try مع الموارد","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"Making input safe","titleAr":"إدخال آمن لا يوقف البرنامج","minutes":30,"practice":9},{"title":"Throwing your own exceptions","titleAr":"رمي الاستثناءات بنفسك: throw","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Checked and unchecked exceptions","titleAr":"الاستثناءات المفحوصة وغير المفحوصة","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Your own exception classes","titleAr":"أصناف الاستثناءات الخاصة بك","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Testing your code","titleAr":"اختبار البرنامج وتتبع الأخطاء","minutes":30,"practice":8},{"title":"Putting it together: a robust registration program","titleAr":"نجمع كل شيء: برنامج تسجيل متين مع اختباراته","minutes":30,"practice":8}],"quiz":12,"lab":{"title":"Safe bank account","titleAr":""},"key":9}
